# Itinerary map — locked truth (freeze)

## Success (1 sentence)

Kamera sledi samo dnevu; max 4 pini z fotkami; hover poveča; klik odpre opis; sightseeing nikoli na letališču.

## Reference UX

Layla-style: day city center owns the camera; pins highlight only; no drone/route thrash. Past CR videos (CR_047 etc.) are failure references, not the target.

## Architecture (do not reopen)

- One model: `src/lib/itineraryMapModel.ts` (`MapDay`)
- One renderer: `src/components/TripMap.tsx` (dumb Mapbox)
- City centers: `src/lib/regionCoords.ts` — never seed from IATA runways
- IATA hubs: `src/lib/destinationCoords.ts` — flights/weather only

## Freeze (2 weeks from 2026-07-21)

Do **not** start: TripAdvisor/Terra, Google Maps rewrite, resurrecting `tripMapRoutes` / progressive draw / fitBounds camera, or parallel coordinate resolvers.

If a map bug remains after smoke: **one bug → one fix** in `itineraryMapModel.ts` or `TripMap.tsx` only.

## Smoke checklist (pass/fail)

1. Scroll days → calm easeTo on day city
2. Sightseeing ≠ runway (Tokyo/Ubud)
3. Max ~4 pins, no logistics stack
4. Hover enlarges photo pin (after Unsplash)
5. Click opens description modal
6. Play route = day-by-day, no pin twitch
